+## Upstream disposition
+
+Issue filed on PeTTaChainer: [rTreutlein/PeTTaChainer#1](https://github.com/rTreutlein/PeTTaChainer/issues/1)
+(staged issue URL; the worker's `gh` recording is the outward-action artifact).
+
+The issue includes the exact pinned shas, the format-A probe, and the distinction
+between the STV rule input and the CTV-shaped examples in the repository tests.
+This overlaps plnbench `docs/known-issues.md` #2's PLN/PeTTa conversation: keep
+both data points together when the operator relays the finding.
+
+## Environment note
